Exclusion Criteria:

Patients who meet any of the following conditions are not allowed to enter this clinical study：

1. After a comprehensive physical examination, vital signs, laboratory examination (blood routine, blood biochemistry, coagulation function, urine routine) and other abnormalities and clinical significance;
